{"seq":3,"slug":"regulator-transfer-report","title":"监管报送与检查应对","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-data-transfer-compliance/transfer-enforce-audit/regulator-transfer-report","wordCount":2427,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"监管报送与检查应对\">监管报送与检查应对</h1><p>前面十一篇都在讲怎么把出境管住。这一篇讲的是被检验的时刻：日常的定期报送、事件驱动的紧急通知、以及收到检查通知后的证据组装。三者的共同点是<strong>时间压力来自外部</strong>——报送和通知有法定时限，检查有法定期限，而你的材料是否齐备取决于前面十几篇的设计是否真的落地。这一篇的价值不在于引入新机制，而在于把已有机制改造成<strong>可对外交付</strong>的形态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-报送的三种触发形态\">核心概念：报送的三种触发形态</h2><p>监管交互按触发方式分三类，每一类的准备策略完全不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形态</th>\n<th>触发</th>\n<th>时限特征</th>\n<th>准备方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>定期报送</td>\n<td>法定周期（年度/季度）</td>\n<td>可在周期内安排</td>\n<td>从留痕与清单自动生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件通知</td>\n<td>数据安全事件/泄露</td>\n<td>极短，小时级</td>\n<td>预置模板 + 预置事实查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检查应对</td>\n<td>监管问询或现场检查</td>\n<td>通常给定期限</td>\n<td>按问询问题组装证据包</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  T[监管交互触发] --&gt; A1[定期: 年度风险评估报告]&#10;  T --&gt; A2[事件: 数据泄露/安全事件通知]&#10;  T --&gt; A3[检查: 书面问询或现场检查]&#10;  A1 --&gt; G[统一数据源层]&#10;  A2 --&gt; G&#10;  A3 --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; S1[出境清单与分类]&#10;  G --&gt; S2[机制绑定与合同]&#10;  G --&gt; S3[评估记录与核验]&#10;  G --&gt; S4[出境事件留痕]\">graph TD\n  T[监管交互触发] --&gt; A1[定期: 年度风险评估报告]\n  T --&gt; A2[事件: 数据泄露/安全事件通知]\n  T --&gt; A3[检查: 书面问询或现场检查]\n  A1 --&gt; G[统一数据源层]\n  A2 --&gt; G\n  A3 --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; S1[出境清单与分类]\n  G --&gt; S2[机制绑定与合同]\n  G --&gt; S3[评估记录与核验]\n  G --&gt; S4[出境事件留痕]</pre><p>统一数据源层是这一章的核心主张：三类报送问的问题高度重叠，若为每一类单独准备一份材料，会得到三份互不一致的口径。正确做法是把清单、机制绑定、评估记录、事件留痕作为唯一事实来源，报送材料只是这些数据的<strong>视图</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"年度风险评估报告\">年度风险评估报告</h2><p>《网络数据安全管理条例》第三十三条要求重要数据处理者每年开展风险评估并向省级以上主管部门报送报告，内容涵盖处理情况、管理制度、技术措施、风险事件、重要数据对外处理和数据出境等；大型网络平台还应说明关键业务和供应链安全情况（<a href=\"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/content/202409/content_6977766.htm\">网络数据安全管理条例</a>）。第二十八条把适用范围扩大了一档：处理 1000 万人以上个人信息的处理者还须遵守第三十条、第三十二条关于重要数据处理者的规定。</p>\n<p>这条规定的工程含义是：报送不是年末写一份文档，而是<strong>全年数据必须可聚合</strong>。报告里的每一节都对应一类必须持续维护的数据。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 年度报告的数据出口: 出境活动汇总&#10;SELECT date_trunc(&#39;quarter&#39;, e.occurred_at)         AS period,&#10;       e.importer_cc,&#10;       count(DISTINCT e.subject_hash)               AS subjects,&#10;       count(*)                                     AS events,&#10;       sum(e.record_count)                          AS records,&#10;       array_agg(DISTINCT e.mechanism)              AS mechanisms,&#10;       count(*) FILTER (WHERE e.decision = &#39;blocked&#39;) AS blocked_events&#10;FROM transfer_event e&#10;WHERE e.occurred_at &gt;= $year_start&#10;GROUP BY 1, 2&#10;ORDER BY 1, 2;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 年度报告的数据出口: 出境活动汇总</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> date_trunc(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'quarter'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">occurred_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> period</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">importer_cc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">subject_hash</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)               </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subjects,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> events,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">record_count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> records,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       array_agg(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">mechanism</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mechanisms,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decision</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'blocked'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> blocked_events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transfer_event e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">occurred_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $year_start</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"拦截数量是控制有效性的证据\">拦截数量是控制有效性的证据</h3><p><code>blocked_events</code> 这一列在报送里价值很高：它把「我们的闸门在运行」从一个声明变成一个有数字支撑的事实。监管关心的是控制是否有效，而拦截数量与控制有效性正相关——一个从不拦截任何出境的闸门，要么是不存在，要么是规则过松。</p>\n<p>同样重要的是<strong>报告之间的一致性</strong>。若年度报告里写「本年度向境外传输涉及 8 万人」，而季度报送里四个季度相加是 12 万人，这种矛盾本身就构成风险信号。用同一个视图生成所有周期的报送材料，是避免这类矛盾最省成本的方法。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数据出境安全评估相关的申报\">数据出境安全评估相关的申报</h3><p>中国法域下还有一类专门的申报：安全评估的申报与变更。安全评估结果有效期 3 年、可在届满前 60 个工作日申请延长；更重要的是，通过评估后向境外提供个人信息和重要数据<strong>不得超出评估明确的出境目的、方式、范围、种类和规模</strong>（<a href=\"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/content/202409/content_6977766.htm\">网络数据安全管理条例</a>）。这把安全评估变成了一份有具体参数的许可，因此系统必须能持续回答「当前实际出境是否仍在评估参数范围内」。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE assessment_scope (&#10;  assessment_id BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  approval_ref  TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  approved_at   DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  expires_at    DATE NOT NULL,              -- 批准日起 3 年&#10;  purpose       TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  method        TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  scope_desc    TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  categories    TEXT[] NOT NULL,&#10;  max_scale     INTEGER NOT NULL,           -- 评估明确的规模上限&#10;  UNIQUE (approval_ref)&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 超出评估范围的出境: 传输前必须拦截&#10;CREATE VIEW v_scope_breach AS&#10;SELECT e.data_path, e.importer_cc, s.assessment_id,&#10;       count(DISTINCT e.subject_hash) AS observed_subjects,&#10;       s.max_scale&#10;FROM transfer_event e&#10;JOIN assessment_scope s ON s.assessment_id = $assessment_id&#10;WHERE e.decision = &#39;allowed&#39;&#10;  AND e.occurred_at &gt;= s.approved_at&#10;GROUP BY e.data_path, e.importer_cc, s.assessment_id, s.max_scale&#10;HAVING count(DISTINCT e.subject_hash) &gt; s.max_scale;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> assessment_scope</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  assessment_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  approval_ref  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  approved_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  expires_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 批准日起 3 年</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  purpose       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  method        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scope_desc    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  categories    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  max_scale     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,           </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 评估明确的规模上限</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (approval_ref)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 超出评估范围的出境: 传输前必须拦截</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VIEW</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> v_scope_breach</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">data_path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">importer_cc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">assessment_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">subject_hash</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> observed_subjects,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">max_scale</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transfer_event e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> assessment_scope s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">assessment_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $assessment_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decision</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'allowed'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">occurred_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">approved_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">data_path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">importer_cc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">assessment_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">max_scale</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">subject_hash</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">max_scale</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"规模上限是运行约束\">规模上限是运行约束</h3><p>把「规模上限」做成一个可比较的数字，并在出境前而非报送时校验，是把评估参数从文书约束变成运行约束的关键。这也让延长申请有了自动化依据：当观测规模接近上限时提前触发延长流程，而不是等越线后补救。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据安全事件通知\">数据安全事件通知</h2><p>事件通知的时间预算是整套体系里最紧的。GDPR 侧控制者的窗口是知悉后不迟于 <strong>72 小时</strong>通知监管机构，内容至少包括泄露性质、受影响数据主体与记录的大致类别与数量、联系人信息、可能的后果、以及已采取或拟采取的措施；信息无法一次提供时可以<strong>分阶段</strong>提交而不构成迟延；无论是否通知，控制者都必须记录每一起泄露的事实、影响与补救措施（<a href=\"https://gdpr-info.eu/art-33-gdpr/\">Article 33 GDPR</a>）。「分阶段提交」这一条对工程设计的启示很直接：不要在等待完整影响范围确认时才发出第一条通知，而应当把通知拆成「初步通知 + 补充」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant D as 检测/接收方&#10;  participant C as 合规值班&#10;  participant R as 监管机构&#10;  D-&gt;&gt;C: 事件上报(初步事实)&#10;  C-&gt;&gt;R: 72h 内初步通知(性质+大致范围+联系人)&#10;  C-&gt;&gt;C: 影响评估(受影响字段与人数)&#10;  C-&gt;&gt;R: 补充通知(精确范围+补救措施)&#10;  C-&gt;&gt;C: 归档: 事件记录+决策依据\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant D as 检测/接收方\n  participant C as 合规值班\n  participant R as 监管机构\n  D-&gt;&gt;C: 事件上报(初步事实)\n  C-&gt;&gt;R: 72h 内初步通知(性质+大致范围+联系人)\n  C-&gt;&gt;C: 影响评估(受影响字段与人数)\n  C-&gt;&gt;R: 补充通知(精确范围+补救措施)\n  C-&gt;&gt;C: 归档: 事件记录+决策依据</pre><p>事件发生后需要立即回答的几个问题，全部依赖前文的产物：<strong>受影响的字段属于什么分类</strong>（来自字段分类）、<strong>涉及哪些接收方实体</strong>（来自清单与事件留痕）、<strong>这些实体所在的法域需要通知哪些监管机构</strong>（来自机制矩阵）、<strong>适用的合同下的通知义务是什么</strong>（来自接收方核验里的 <code>breach_notify_hours</code>）。能在 72 小时内给出这些答案的前提是这些数据平时就是结构化的——这也解释了为什么接收方核验记录里的通知时限必须是一个数字字段而不是合同里的一个段落。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"on_breach(b):&#10;  affected = events_matching(b.importer_entity, b.time_range)&#10;  fields   = distinct_fields(affected)&#10;  cats     = classify(fields)                      # 复用分类引擎&#10;  auths    = regulators_for(cats, affected.importer_cc)&#10;  draft    = initial_notice(b, cats, approx_scale(affected))&#10;  notifier.send_immediately(draft, deadline=now+72h)&#10;  schedule(supplementary_notice, after=impact_assessment(affected))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>on_breach(b):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  affected = events_matching(b.importer_entity, b.time_range)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  fields   = distinct_fields(affected)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  cats     = classify(fields)                      # 复用分类引擎</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  auths    = regulators_for(cats, affected.importer_cc)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  draft    = initial_notice(b, cats, approx_scale(affected))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  notifier.send_immediately(draft, deadline=now+72h)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  schedule(supplementary_notice, after=impact_assessment(affected))</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>approx_scale(affected)</code> 里「大致数量」是被显式允许的措辞，因此不必等到精确计数才发通知——精确计数往往要数天，而法则允许先给出估计值。把这个判断写进流程，可以避免团队为了精确数字而错过时限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"检查应对-把问询变成查询\">检查应对：把问询变成查询</h2><p>检查应对的失败模式不是「没有合规」，而是「说不清合规」。监管的一个典型问题会横跨多个系统，需要把清单、机制、评估、合同、事件五类数据拼在一起。把常见问题预先做成查询，能把响应时间从数周压到数小时。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>监管问题</th>\n<th>需要的数据</th>\n<th>对应视图</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>向某国的传输有哪些</td>\n<td>清单 + 事件留痕</td>\n<td>按 <code>importer_cc</code> 聚合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>某条链路的合法性依据</td>\n<td>机制绑定 + 合同 + 评估</td>\n<td>按 <code>data_path</code> 联结</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接收方是否在充分性范围内</td>\n<td>接收方实体 + 认定范围</td>\n<td>实体级匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否有未申报的再传输</td>\n<td>再传输登记册 + 指纹检测</td>\n<td>差集视图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>敏感数据的出境规模</td>\n<td>字段分类 + 事件记录数</td>\n<td>按分类聚合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史某时点的规则依据</td>\n<td>矩阵版本 + 判定记录</td>\n<td>按 <code>decided_at</code> 时点还原</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"时点还原为什么依赖判定记录\">时点还原为什么依赖判定记录</h3><p>第五行与第六行是两类容易准备不足的问题。<strong>敏感数据的出境规模</strong>要求分类是可查询的字段而不是评审文档里的结论；<strong>历史某时点的规则依据</strong>要求每次判定都保存了当时的矩阵版本与命中的规则——这正是 <a href=\"../transfer-mechanism-config/multi-region-transfer-rule\">多法域传输机制配置</a> 中 <code>transfer_decision.matched_rules</code> 存在的理由。没有这一层，你只能回答「现在为什么可以」，回答不了「当时为什么认为可以」。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 监管问询: 给定链路, 还原某时点的完整合法性依据&#10;SELECT d.data_path, d.decided_at, d.matrix_version,&#10;       d.matched_rules, d.binding_mechanism, d.prerequisites,&#10;       c.template, c.module, c.status AS contract_status,&#10;       c.effective_at, c.filed_at,&#10;       t.status AS tia_status, t.next_review_at,&#10;       v.importer_role, v.breach_notify_hours&#10;FROM transfer_decision d&#10;LEFT JOIN contract_instance   c ON c.contract_id = $contract_id&#10;LEFT JOIN tia_assessment      t ON t.tia_id = c.tia_id&#10;LEFT JOIN importer_verification v ON v.verification_id = c.verification_id&#10;WHERE d.data_path = $path&#10;  AND d.decided_at &lt;= $as_of&#10;ORDER BY d.decided_at DESC&#10;LIMIT 1;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 监管问询: 给定链路, 还原某时点的完整合法性依据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">data_path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decided_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">matrix_version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">matched_rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">binding_mechanism</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">prerequisites</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">template</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> contract_status,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">effective_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">filed_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tia_status, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">next_review_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">importer_role</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">breach_notify_hours</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transfer_decision d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> contract_instance   c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">contract_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $contract_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tia_assessment      t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tia_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tia_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> importer_verification v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">verification_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">verification_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">data_path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">path</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decided_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $as_of</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">decided_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段查询回答的是「在 <code>$as_of</code> 这个时点，这条链路的合法性依据是什么」——一个检查中最难回答的问题。<code>ORDER BY ... LIMIT 1</code> 配合时点条件，让历史状态可还原，而不是只能看到被后续变更覆盖后的现状。</p>\n<h3 id=\"证据包的边界\">证据包的边界</h3><p>组装证据包时必须注意一条与最小化原则同源的纪律：<strong>交给监管的材料本身也要最小化</strong>。一份证据包里不应包含字段的实际值、不应包含与问询问题无关的链路、不应包含超出问询时间范围的记录。这不是为了保护被问询方，而是因为超出必要范围的个人数据传输本身也是一次处理活动，且一旦提交就产生了新的副本与新的接收方。判断「哪些字段属于必要范围」的依据来自 <a href=\"../outbound-data-inventory/sensitive-data-transfer-scope\">敏感/个人数据出境范围识别</a> 中的分类结果——分类越严的字段，在证据包中出现的形式应当越抽象（例如只给字段身份与数量，不给样本值）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三类监管交互（定期报送、事件通知、检查应对）应共用<strong>统一数据源层</strong>，报送材料只是清单、机制、评估、事件四类数据的视图；避免多口径矛盾。</li>\n<li>年度风险评估报告的每一节都要求全年数据可聚合；<strong>拦截数量</strong>是证明闸门有效的高价值指标。</li>\n<li>安全评估的<strong>目的/方式/范围/种类/规模</strong>是运行约束：规模上限应做成可比较数字并在出境前校验，接近上限时提前触发延长流程。</li>\n<li>事件通知的时间预算最紧：72 小时内可提交<strong>初步通知</strong>（大幅数量被允许），精确范围随后分阶段补充。</li>\n<li>检查应对的核心是<strong>把问询变成查询</strong>；历史时点还原依赖保存了矩阵版本与命中规则的判定记录。</li>\n<li>提交给监管的证据包自身也要最小化：不含字段值、不含无关链路、不超出问询时间范围。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"监管报送与检查应对","id":"监管报送与检查应对"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：报送的三种触发形态","id":"核心概念-报送的三种触发形态"},{"level":2,"text":"年度风险评估报告","id":"年度风险评估报告"},{"level":3,"text":"拦截数量是控制有效性的证据","id":"拦截数量是控制有效性的证据"},{"level":3,"text":"数据出境安全评估相关的申报","id":"数据出境安全评估相关的申报"},{"level":3,"text":"规模上限是运行约束","id":"规模上限是运行约束"},{"level":2,"text":"数据安全事件通知","id":"数据安全事件通知"},{"level":2,"text":"检查应对：把问询变成查询","id":"检查应对-把问询变成查询"},{"level":3,"text":"时点还原为什么依赖判定记录","id":"时点还原为什么依赖判定记录"},{"level":3,"text":"证据包的边界","id":"证据包的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"出境请求留痕与证据留存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-data-transfer-compliance/transfer-enforce-audit/outbound-request-log-attest"},"next":null}